('item-samaki-choma', 'samaki-samaki-mwenge', 'cat-samaki-grills', 'Whole Red Snapper Choma', 'Changu Mzima wa Kuchoma', 'Freshly caught red snapper marinated with garlic, lime, and crushed chilies.', 'Changu mbichi wa baharini aliyekolea kitunguu saumu, ndimu na pilipili.', 22000, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534422298391-e4f8c172dddb?w=800&q=80', 15, TRUE, 30, ARRAY['Seafood', 'Gluten-Free']),
